\dotfile dox/example_noninterference_chain.dot "Definition at last-use line allows register reuse"

</div>

@subsection ext_t5_fusion Transitive web fusion

The following example mirrors the overlapping `x` ranges used in the web-fusion tests.
Even if not every range overlaps every other range directly, the overlap graph
is connected, so all ranges belong to one web.

